.TH EVERY-CLI 1 "2025-01-01" "1.0.0" "every-cli Manual"
.SH NAME
every-cli \- stream and download anime, movies, TV, cartoons, YouTube, and live TV from the terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B every-cli
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIQUERY\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B every-cli
is a cross-platform terminal tool to stream and download free anime, movies, TV shows, cartoons, YouTube videos, and live IPTV channels. It unifies the functionality of ani-cli, mov-cli, ytfzf, and yt-dlp into a single CLI.
.PP
All sources use a multi-level fallback chain with YouTube as the universal last resort.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-category " " \fICATEGORY\fR
Content category: anime, movies, tv, cartoons, youtube, live
.TP
.BR \-e ", " \-\-episode " " \fIEP\fR
Episode number or range (e.g. 5 or 1-12)
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quality " " \fIQ\fR
Video quality: best, 1080, 720, 480, 360 (default: best)
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-download
Download instead of streaming
.TP
.B \-\-dub
Use dubbed audio (anime only)
.TP
.B \-\-vlc
Use VLC as media player
.TP
.B \-\-no-color
Disable terminal colours
.TP
.B \-\-continue
Resume from watch history
.TP
.BR \-U ", " \-\-update
Self-update from GitHub
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print version and exit
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help message
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B EVERY_CLI_PLAYER
Media player to use (default: mpv). Supported: mpv, vlc, iina
.TP
.B EVERY_CLI_QUALITY
Default video quality
.TP
.B EVERY_CLI_LANG
Anime language: sub or dub (default: sub)
.TP
.B EVERY_CLI_DOWNLOAD_DIR
Download directory (default: ~/Videos/every-cli)
.TP
.B EVERY_CLI_COLOR
Set to 0 to disable colours
.TP
.B EVERY_CLI_HIST_DIR
History directory (default: ~/.local/share/every-cli)
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
every-cli                                  # interactive menu
every-cli -c anime "Attack on Titan"       # search anime
every-cli -c movies "Inception"            # search movies
every-cli -c tv "Breaking Bad"             # search TV shows
every-cli -c cartoons "SpongeBob"          # search cartoons
every-cli -c youtube "lo-fi mix"           # search YouTube
every-cli -c live                          # IPTV browser
every-cli -c anime -d -e 1-13 "Naruto"     # download episodes
.fi
.SH FALLBACK CHAIN
.nf
ANIME:    HiAnime → AllAnime → YouTube
MOVIES:   VidSrc.to → YouTube
TV:       VidSrc.to → YouTube
CARTOONS: ToonGet → WCOFun → KimCartoon → YouTube
YOUTUBE:  yt-dlp (direct)
LIVE TV:  iptv-org M3U (direct)
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/every-cli/config
User configuration file (sourced as shell)
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/every-cli/history
Watch history
.SH DEPENDENCIES
curl, fzf, mpv, yt-dlp, ffmpeg (required); curl-impersonate-chrome, vlc (optional)
.SH LICENSE
GPL-3.0
.SH SEE ALSO
